    "Matched explicit eager runtime fell203-205us to72-77us; median paired ratio0.3533486562 (64.665% reduction).",
    "Default eager control median candidate/baseline ratio1.0132884951; explicit/default within candidate1.0218206951, so the explicit choice remains about2% more expensive than default.",
    "Graph explicit ratio0.9757168689 tracks default control0.9758582320; per-seed default-normalized median1.0005104214 supports no graph benefit.",
    "Candidate explicit first call performs one AlgoCheck and no heuristic; warmed eager/capture performs neither. Actual native descriptor-used returns1; no cached fallback accepted. Default still queries one heuristic per public invocation. Replay has no native setup calls.",
    "Natural baseline-v2 winnerordinal0 and candidate-v1/v2 matched descriptor follow the actual finite runtime-profile minimum. Separate forced explicit persistence controls are not claimed as profiled winners.",
    "All three fresh warm pairs preserve natural and forced explicit file bytes and consume winners in bare execution and graph capture without profiling.",
    "This addresses recurring setup common to both v1/v2; it does not establish that v2 candidate selection generally outperforms v1."
  ],
